---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import shot from '../assets/work/futureme-home.png';
---
<div class="instrument">
  <div class="instrument-bar">
    <span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
    <span>futureme-ai-6rgq.onrender.com</span>
    <span>live</span>
  </div>
  <Image src={shot} widths={[640, 960, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 56vw" quality={80} loading="lazy" alt="FutureMe public demo homepage with the headline “Give a decision some room.” and a card comparing a course with a project." />
  <div class="contract">
    <div class="yes"><h4>The public server accepts</h4><ul role="list"><li>A built-in example ID</li><li>One of three fictional scenarios</li></ul></div>
    <div class="no"><h4>…and rejects</h4><ul role="list"><li>Personal questions</li><li>Custom profiles</li><li>Notes and save requests</li></ul></div>
  </div>
  <div class="fm-rules">
    <p><b>Same seeded model</b>Both options run through one simulation and one fictional baseline.</p>
    <p><b>Ranges, not promises</b>Medians as lines, the modeled P10–P90 range as shading.</p>
    <p><b>No hidden winner</b>No overall winner is calculated; money is one lens of four.</p>
  </div>
</div>
